e":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She came to Japan from Racronia to be married to Shuuma. Calen is the 100th daughter in the Officinalis family, one of the three big households. Her marriage to Shuuma is arranged and thus for her, love is a low priority."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Calen was raised in the vampire society, and for this reason she can never understand why Shuuma doesn't try to drink from human beings. She is mature as a vampire, so she can control her impulse to feed."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"When Calen first came to Japan, her naiveté was exposed because she wasn't aware of the differences between vampires and humans. Now after making a friend named Sakurako, she is enjoying her life."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Prefundia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c34608"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"柊真と結婚するためにラクロニアから日本にやってきた少女。柊真のクラスに転入してきて、そのまま家に転がり込む。柊真と結婚することは既に彼女の中では規定事項となっているため、恋愛などは二の次。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"オフィシナリス家は三氏族のひとつで、カレンは１００番目の娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"吸血鬼の社会で暮らしてきたため、柊真が人間の血を吸おうとしないことに理解が及ばない。その件について柊真と意見を衝突させることもしばしばあるのだが、決して感情的にはならず、難しく考えることを嫌う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"日本に来た当初は世間知らずが露呈していたが、櫻子という友人ができてからいろいろと人間社会を満喫している。お嬢様然としていて、上品な口調で話す。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"オフィシナリス家の吸血鬼として、相手を洗脳する能力を有している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"吸血鬼として完成されているため、ある程度の吸血衝動を抑えることができる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"朝が苦手で、いつもリビングで眠そうにしている姿はお嬢様とはかけ離れている気がしないでもない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7074","sourceWorkId":"22149","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"吸血鬼氏族の一角・オフィシナリス家の100番目の娘。 上品な口調で話すお嬢様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"柊真と結婚するために同じクラスに転入してきて、そのまま家にも転がり込む。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただし彼女の中では柊真との結婚は規定事項となっているため、恋愛などは二の次。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"朝が苦手で、いつもリビングで眠そうにしている姿は とてもお嬢様とは思えない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"当初は世間知らずが露呈していたが、櫻子という友人ができてからは人間社会を満喫している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"オフィシナリス家の吸血鬼として、相手を洗脳する能力を有している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また吸血鬼として完成されているため、ある程度の吸血衝動を抑えることができる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人間の血を吸おうとしない柊真とは意見を衝突させることもあるが、あまり難しいことは考えない。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"35298"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/58/589059dd37b22c08d2e58208303f388ebc5f38e670ec3f05443b1e06f47f00f1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/94/94478e360362af2a6e700360e6c040d0dfd471e54232ea3a3ff51ae887eb1299.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"北村彩","creatorId":"vndb:s912","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s912","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s912","name":"北村 彩","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:137670:35298:6046:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c34609","characterName":"マリ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"35299","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"137670"}],"egsCharacterIds":["7076"],"vndbCharacterId":"c34609"},"originalCharacterName":"マリ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A werewolf maid who used to serve the Embroche family. She is not a familiar spirit so she can exist even after Shuuma's father is gone. While Mari was searching for Shuuma to revive the Embroche family again, Iris found her and began using her as a gofer."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is disappointed that Shuuma is not dependable as either a master or vampire. Still, she is serving him as a houseworker, hoping the Embroche family will someday be revived. Mari says whatever she thinks and sometimes it is too direct and poisonous towards her master Shuuma, basically though she is obedient and nice. She gets wolf ears and a tail when surprised."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Prefundia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c34609"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"柊真の実家アンブロシェ家に仕えていた人狼のメイド。眷属ではなかったため、柊真の父親が消滅したあとも存在できている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"アンブロシェ家再興のため柊真の行方を捜していたところ、イリス・プミラに目をつけられ使いっぱしりをさせられていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人としても吸血鬼としても頼りない柊真に呆れながらも、料理に家事にと甲斐甲斐しく世話をする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"思ったことは言う性格で、柊真に対しても遠慮なくズケズケと毒を吐くこともあるが、基本従順でいい子。びっくりすると犬耳・尻尾が生える。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"柊真が初めて血を吸った相手。吸血衝動に耐えられない柊真のためにその身を差し出すが、未熟なため眷属化にまではいたっていない。柊真が吸血鬼として覚醒することを願っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人狼族として、人間に迫害された経験があるため、人間嫌い。そのため、人間の多い学園では物静かになって、借りてきた猫状態になる。犬なのに。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7076","sourceWorkId":"22149","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"柊真の実家・アンブロシェ家に仕えていた人狼のメイド。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"眷属ではなかったため、柊真の父親が消滅した後も存在できている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"思ったことは言う性格で、柊真に対しても遠慮なく毒を吐くが、基本 従順で良い子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人としても吸血鬼としても頼りない柊真に呆れながらも、甲斐甲斐しく世話をしてくれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"柊真が初めて血を吸うことになる相手で、びっくりすると犬耳・尻尾が生える。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人間に迫害された経験があるため人間嫌いで、学園では借りてきた猫状態になる。 犬なのに。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"35299"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/12/1289dd4ea3f60c9b7e340c4bd75f4581eb2feaabe3b4ef40f3ab989abd20a2aa.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c9/c96ab6837111a07ed334e6d8f863dcb18430c7ae5537ff2a03349b2f05b28254.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"新堂真弓","creatorId":"vndb:s1427","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1427","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1427","name":"新堂 真弓","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:137670:35299:6166:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c34610","characterName":"神代 葵","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"35300","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"137670"}],"egsCharacterIds":["7075"],"vndbCharacterId":"c34610"},"originalCharacterName":"神代 葵","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"An agent of the Vatican's Special Service Agency \"Rubina.\" She came to town with Lycoris, after getting information that an important vampire is there."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Aoi is one of a few people who can communicate directly with God. She has spent her whole life killing monsters, it is the top priority order assigned to her. Aoi prefers physical work over cognitive thinking and focuses on things in the moment without considering the future."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her specialty is a combination attack with two swords, using her above average physical ability. Her purpose is freeing her partner Lycoris who became Iris's familiar spirit, so she will move together with Shuuma for a while."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Prefundia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c34610"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"教皇庁特務機関“ルビナ”のエージェント。教皇庁の中でも少ない神と交信ができる人物。柊真のクラスメイトとして彼の監視をする任務につく。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"考えるよりも体を動かしていたほうが好きで、目の前のことに囚われやすい猪突猛進型。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"パートナーであるリコリスと共にこの街にやってきて始祖の息子である柊真を探していたが、リコリスとの連絡が途絶。その焦りからか、人目があろうと学園内であろうと柊真のことを襲撃してきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"言動は乱暴で、人付き合いが苦手。化物を倒すことを至上命令として、これまで生きてきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大の吸血鬼嫌い。そのため生粋の吸血鬼であるカレンとは折り合いが悪く、ことあるごとに突っかかるが、実力差もあってカレンはまともにとりあわない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"リコリスをイリスの手から解放するという共通の目的のために、しばしば行動を共にすることになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人並み外れた身体能力の有し、神の祝福を受けた双剣や様々な武器を操るが、それでも真の吸血鬼には一歩届かない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7075","sourceWorkId":"22149","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"教皇庁特務機関・ルビナのエージェント。 神と交信ができる数少ない人物。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"考えるよりも身体を動かすほうが好きで、目の前のことに囚われやすい猪突猛進型。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"言動は乱暴で、人付き合いが苦手。 化物を倒すことを至上命令として生きてきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大の吸血鬼嫌いで、生粋の吸血鬼であるカレンに対して ことあるごとに突っかかるが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"残念ながら実力差もあって カレンはまともに取り合わない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"柊真のクラスメイトとして、彼の監視任務に就いていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかしパートナーであるリコリスとの連絡が途絶し、その焦りから柊真を襲撃してしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"以後はリコリスをイリスの手から解放するため、柊真と行動を共にする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人並み外れた身体能力を有し、神の祝福を受けた様々な武器を操るが、それでも吸血鬼の始祖には一歩届かない。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"35300"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6c/6ca75698a89111f5afc556a8eab3a8518f6e9d99388eb92f143cd3d60b107547.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/14/14b24891a985691dc696ec1b57cb1fbea178604caec1d94370a230e08e32a8ce.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"立石めぐみ","creatorId":"vndb:s646","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s646","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s646","name":"立石 めぐみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:137670:35300:10027:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c34611","characterName":"リコリス・ラジアータ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"35301","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"137670"}],"egsCharacterIds":["7077"],"vndbCharacterId":"c34611"},"originalCharacterName":"リコリス・ラジアータ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Formerly Aoi's partner and an agent from Rubina, but now is Iris's familiar spirit. Since then, she holds a big scythe named \"Crepusculefaux\" which was provided by Iris. She is constantly coming up to Shuuma and causing trouble but retreats many times after Shuuma resists."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Lycoris is always energetic and acts like an idiot."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Everyone thinks this is just the evil effect of becoming a vampire, but it's not true. Unexpectedly though, people realize she was the brains behind daredevil Aoi when they were still a team."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Prefundia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c34611"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"イリスの眷属となってしまった葵のパートナー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"常にハイテンションで、おバカな言動が目立つ。吸血鬼化の弊害かと思われたが、そんなことはなかった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"吸血鬼化してからというもの、幾度と無く柊真たちの前に現れては騒動を起こす。彼女の目的は柊真をイリス・プミラの下に連れて行くことなのだが、柊真や葵の抵抗にあい性気が足りずに撤退することがしばしば。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"葵とコンビを組んでいた際は、猪武者な葵を支援する役回りを担っていて、頭脳担当はリコリスという普段の言動からは想像ができない事実が判明する。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7077","sourceWorkId":"22149","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"イリスの眷属となってしまった葵のパートナー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"常にハイテンションで おバカな言動が目立つ（吸血鬼化の弊害と思われたが、そんなことはなかった）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"葵とのコンビでは意外にも頭脳担当で、猪武者な葵を支援する役回りを担っていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"吸血鬼になってからは、幾度となく柊真たちの前に現れては騒動を起こす。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"目的は柊真をイリスのもとへ連れて行くことだが、いつも抵抗されているうちに精気が尽きて撤退することがしばしば。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"35301"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/04/04dc0d269bda2565ddb3abee9a9077b88b250a36657dc776f18c0ac78c3658d6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d8/d89a7daec0ac9c0c7b86896dd14a955aa1a29f9be5f1fd2056859d469234e522.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"中村麻未","creatorId":"vndb:s980","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s980","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s980","name":"中村 麻未","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:137670:35301:15637:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c34613","characterName":"道明寺 櫻子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"35303","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"137670"}],"egsCharacterIds":["7079"],"vndbCharacterId":"c34613"},"originalCharacterName":"道明寺 櫻子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Shuuma's classmate, playmate, and an inspiring person. Shuuma has known her for a long time, but she is not his childhood friend. After Shuuma pulled a prank on her, Sakurako became a \"mayoler\" (a mayonnaise lover) who thinks it's normal to drink mayonnaise straight."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Sakurako has many friends and is sociable. Naturally, she became friends with Calen who has a different standard from normal life, also with Aoi who is not a good conversationalist."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a rare person in that she talks with Shuuma in a natural way, even though every other female in the school is falling in love with him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Lycoris turned her into a vampire by sucking her blood, causing Sakurako to attack Shuuma."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Prefundia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c34613"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"柊真のクラスメイトで悪友。昔からの知り合いだが幼馴染というわけではない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"柊真のイタズラでマヨネーズが大好きになってしまった。直飲み当然のマヨラー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おバカなムードメーカー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"社交的で友達が多く人付き合いの苦手な葵にも普通に接する。カレンのお気に入り。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"柊真が半端な吸血鬼となってから学園中の異性が彼に対してソワソワした対応をするなかいつも通りに接してくれる稀有な存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"放課後は夜まで遊びまくるためリコリスの毒牙にかかってしまい、眷属化して柊真を襲ってしまう。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7079","sourceWorkId":"22149","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"柊真のクラスメイトで悪友、おバカなムードメーカー。社交的で友達が多く、人付き合いの苦手な葵にも普通に接する。 カレンのお気に入り。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"柊真とは昔からの知り合いだが、幼なじみというほどではない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ちなみに柊真のイタズラでマヨネーズが大好きになってしまった。 直飲み当然のマヨラー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園中の異性が柊真に対してソワソワする中、普段通りに接してくれる稀有な存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかしリコリスに血を吸われて眷属化してしまい、柊真を襲ってしまう。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"35303"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4e/4ea098b0e9c0018386b883273de72e1511da576716aa49ff53a258597f8ab738.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d5/d52dd37654e72022e63bf053e712b0e02fe3200f4b410dba01ebb6c7a70cd521.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"近藤祐記","creatorId":"vndb:s1412","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1412","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1412","name":"近藤 祐記","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:137670:35303:5904:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c34614","characterName":"大峰 楓","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"35304","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"137670"}],"egsCharacterIds":["7080"],"vndbCharacterId":"c34614"},"originalCharacterName":"大峰 楓","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Shuuma's junior schoolmate. Kaede calls Shuuma a brother. After his mother passed away, Kaede and her family took care of Shuuma."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Later she became friends with Mari who does all the housework for Shuuma, but Shuuma never realized they were friends."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Prefundia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c34614"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ご近所のものしずかな後輩。生物部に所属。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"柊真のことをお兄ちゃんと呼んで慕っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"柊真の母親が亡くなった当時、落ち込んでいる彼を家族ぐるみで気にかけていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ご近所づきあいということで、草薙家の家事の一切を取り仕切るマリとは柊真が気づかないうちに知り合いになっていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最近まで体調が悪く学園を休んでいた。原因はリコリスに血を吸われていたため。そのせいで、眷属化しており柊真を襲ってしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"秘密にしている性癖がある。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7080","sourceWorkId":"22149","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ご近所の物静かな少女で、柊真のことを 「お兄ちゃん」 と呼び慕っている後輩。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ご近所付き合いもあり、草薙家の家事の一切を取り仕切るマリとは知り合い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"柊真の母親が亡くなった当時、落ち込んでいる彼を家族ぐるみで気に掛けてくれた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"誰にも言っていない秘密の性癖があるらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"リコリスに血を吸われて眷属化してしまい、柊真を襲ってしまう。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"35304"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/49/4930da102cab4f7198a98daad414a26a2a45f61045f4f6dc0345b1b8551e8046.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5a/5a934c7fe749df71d7f18079444a999293ce4cb2927c7845c25072ead08fb12a.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"平山ゆかり","creatorId":"vndb:s285","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s285","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s285","name":"東かりん","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:137670:35304:5905:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c39402","characterName":"草薙 柊真","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"219779","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"137670"}],"egsCharacterIds":["7073"],"vndbCharacterId":"c39402"},"originalCharacterName":"草薙 柊真","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Shuuma lost his mother one month ago; his only blood relative. Before she passed away, he received a keepsake ring from her which he now wears as a necklace."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"After coming to grips with this reality, a vampire named Iris abducts Shuuma in an attempt to \"awaken\" him. She claims that his deceased father was the head of Embroche: one of the original vampire families, and special within their world."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Shuuma now struggles with an impulse to suck blood, an aversion to sunlight, and a mysterious aura that is attracting many females to him. Still, he is trying to have a normal, human life. Since becoming a vampire though, many eccentric people have begun surrounding him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Prefundia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c39402"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"常識知らずな面々が集まるなか、常識を説こうとして空まわる苦労人。ボケとツッコミ、ノリツッコミも完備している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"神光学園に在学。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一月前に母親を亡くし、形見の指輪をネックレスとして身に着けている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"心の整理をつけた矢先に、イリス・プミラの差し金によって、ラクロニアの古城に連れてこられる。これまで人間として普通に生活してきたが、イリスから自分の出生について聞かされる。彼の父親は吸血鬼の中でも特別な存在である始祖のひとりで、ラクロニアにある三つの吸血鬼氏族の一角、アンブロシェ家の当主だった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その父親が先日消滅したことで、アンブロシェの眷属は全滅。残ったのはわずかばかりの従者と一人息子の柊真だけとなる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"残りのふたつの氏族はそれぞれ柊真の行方を探っていたのだが、先に見つけたのがプミラ家のイリス。彼女は柊真を始祖として覚醒させ、自分の手駒にしようと目論んでいた。イリスの配下になることを拒絶した柊真は、隙を見て古城を脱出する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"中途半端に覚醒されてしまった柊真は、太陽の光や吸血衝動、異性を必要以上に惹きつけてしまうという弊害に悩まされつつも、普通の学園生活をおくろうと頑張るのだが……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7073","sourceWorkId":"22149","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"神光学園に通う男子学生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"常識知らずな面々が集まる中、常識を説こうとして空回る苦労人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ボケとツッコミ、ノリツッコミも完備している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"父親は吸血鬼氏族の一角・アンブロシェ家当主で、吸血鬼の中でも特別な存在・始祖。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その血を引いていたためイリスに狙われ、始祖として中途半端に覚醒させられてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"吸血衝動やチャーム、太陽光にも悩まされつつ、普通の学園生活を送ろうと頑張るのだが……。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"219779"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/76/763486607fa21638bd5b21f2f60be205eed84f9405186a469397084e0ca078a3.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ab/ab5a11b02fd10fcef072ca04a30debb2c66c49b3e6aea637f3c220fc665458bb.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c34612","characterName":"イリス・プミラ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c34612"},"originalCharacterName":"イリス・プミラ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is the one who \"awakened\" Shuuma as a vampire. Arrogant attitude, haughty language, and young-looking, but her true character is a progenitor of vampires who stayed alive for two thousand years."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Out of the three households, she is the only person still alive who never alternated."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She always interferes with the Embroche family, ever since having a fight with the first Embroche. It seems like she has a purpose in making Lycoris, her familiar spirit, sometimes attack Shuuma."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Prefundia"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Despite being a main character, Iris does not have her own route."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c34612"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b9/b983b270a1c88f2c83c8426f3a456bd3d59a848c219418fa52b405ccfbb1349d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7b/7b5af6daecb27584007aab77a8f0ddd018ff9d9987c5f17787a800b50adc36e2.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"御苑生 メイ","creatorId":"vndb:s278","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s278","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s278","name":"小山 さほみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:64811","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c62368","characterName":"ロートス・アンブロシ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c62368"},"originalCharacterName":"ロートス・アンブロシ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Shuuma's (deceased) father and the former Progenitor of the Embroche family."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"A piece of his soul inhabits a ring Shuuma's mother gave to him before her passing and he occasionally speaks to Shuuma through it to give his commentary on various situations."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"He is also a lolicon."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c62368"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c63437","characterName":"イノッシ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c63437"},"originalCharacterName":"イノッシ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2e/2e9f53b7e05ede48bfc8db71811bb8f033e658e51630b1a64ed0fabcf1d8dd3d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/96/9600362eb2d0c70698d73f3b862a4198a2504179bf011231640da2ab8d288206.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c63438","characterName":"アコナイト・アンブロシ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c63438"},"originalCharacterName":"アコナイト・アンブロシ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Aconite was the very first vampire leader and the main progenitor of the Embroche vampire family tribe and he was also the first to wield the legendary Deese Morte greatsword. Once an extremely powerful vampire, he is long thought to be dead but there are some indications that he still might be alive in some form through the blood of his descendants."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c63438"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1e/1e2abf90243f3cbf8fb54c19604a23a8699dedd2a1c67a32f4a2600a1e61d3a8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/62/62dfae8c784885e078fef3a2794eda70fe5088d9cb647ee67c7fac7f865eb4c1.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p1810","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:3088","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p1810","name":"onomatope*","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:22149:3088","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p5854","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p5854","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p5854","name":"MiKandi Japan合同会社","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:123750:v17825","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p5854","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p5854","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p5854","name":"MiKandi Japan合同会社","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:139979:v17825","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p5854","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p5854","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p5854","name":"MiKandi Japan合同会社","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-nati